          "text": "okay i'm already outside um nobody else is in the house it's just me i think i'm okay the headache's going away a little",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "I'm glad you're out of the house. Please stay outside and call 911 or the gas company from there, even though the headache is easing. They can check the air and shut things off safely.\n\nOnce it's shut off, would you like us to book a technician to come look at the system?",
