        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "okay yeah i'll call them right after this can you just send someone now though i don't really want to be going back in there",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "I can set that up. The technician can only come once the problem has been shut off, so please make that call first. I need the address, and your name if you'd like it on the booking.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "sure it's sofia marchetti the address is 23 15 31st street astoria one one one oh two",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Thanks, Sofia. You're in our service area. Let me read back the details. Let me read that back: your home at 23-15 31st Street, Astoria, 11102, and the best number is 631, 555, 0165. Is that right?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "yeah that's right the address and the number um the number i'm calling from that's the one",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Thanks, that's confirmed. This is marked as one of our most urgent calls, so the soonest opening is today, Monday, between 12 and 4. Does that work, or would you rather another time?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "yeah today works between 12 and 4 that's fine thanks i'm gonna call nine one one now okay bye",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "You're booked for today, Monday, between 12 and 4. The technician can only work on it once the gas company or 911 has shut it off and said it's safe, so please stay outside until then. Please call 911 now. Thanks for calling Summit Air, and stay safe. For your safety, I'd recommend hanging up now, getting outside, and calling 911 from there. We'll follow up once you're safe.",
          "said": null
